    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an PvP FPS game where you can engage in high-speed gunfights with full freedom of movement, utilizing two grappling hooks on both sides. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/700b056cc2c7c4ff59b6c611988a749a.poster.avif?t=1727529483\" width=562 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/700b056cc2c7c4ff59b6c611988a749a.webm?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/700b056cc2c7c4ff59b6c611988a749a.mp4?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to grappling, skills can be used to perform a variety of moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/b05cd7c7f7d48b8b9b8edda674bfb9ec.poster.avif?t=1727529483\" width=562 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/b05cd7c7f7d48b8b9b8edda674bfb9ec.webm?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/b05cd7c7f7d48b8b9b8edda674bfb9ec.mp4?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master seven skills, including instant teleportation and bullet time, to battle your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/763695451b9eee3273cd795068ecbe55.poster.avif?t=1727529483\" width=564 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/763695451b9eee3273cd795068ecbe55.webm?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/763695451b9eee3273cd795068ecbe55.mp4?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you and your friends feel like playing something different, like an FPS, we'd be delighted if you could enjoy a quick game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an PvP FPS game where you can engage in high-speed gunfights with full freedom of movement, utilizing two grappling hooks on both sides. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/700b056cc2c7c4ff59b6c611988a749a.poster.avif?t=1727529483\" width=562 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/700b056cc2c7c4ff59b6c611988a749a.webm?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/700b056cc2c7c4ff59b6c611988a749a.mp4?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to grappling, skills can be used to perform a variety of moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/b05cd7c7f7d48b8b9b8edda674bfb9ec.poster.avif?t=1727529483\" width=562 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/b05cd7c7f7d48b8b9b8edda674bfb9ec.webm?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/b05cd7c7f7d48b8b9b8edda674bfb9ec.mp4?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master seven skills, including instant teleportation and bullet time, to battle your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/763695451b9eee3273cd795068ecbe55.poster.avif?t=1727529483\" width=564 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/763695451b9eee3273cd795068ecbe55.webm?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652750/extras/763695451b9eee3273cd795068ecbe55.mp4?t=1727529483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you and your friends feel like playing something different, like an FPS, we'd be delighted if you could enjoy a quick game.</p>",
